# The cost of a forest of the modern spruce A (reports/engine/2026-11-16-modern-trees/tree-cost.md): the sets of
# `scripts/content/fir_set.py forest` put 64, 256 or 1 024 spruces, full or thinned, in a grid 6.6 m apart in the
# basin of Akil's farm east of the meadow east of the tavern, x 515 to 726 m, z -161 to 51 m; `--count 0` is the
# control. Run with the set in PERF_ENV='OPENGOTHIC_CONTENT=<path on the host> OPENGOTHIC_GPU_PASSES=1'.
# The basin is closed by cliffs, crowns of the original's trees and big rocks; the views stand where a sight line
# over them (the world mesh and the boxes of the base's objects) reaches most spruces, all at the south-west of the
# forest, where the forests nest (NEST_ROW of fir_set.py: the block of 64 is x 515 to 568 m, z -131 to -85 m),
# and look at the middle of the block of 64, at noon: the sun stands behind the camera.
#   view-1  inside the block of 64, 1.7 m over the ground between four trunks, east along the forest;
#   view-2  30 m from the edge, from the south end of the rock hill west of the forest, 5 m over its top and
#           46 m over the forest's ground;
#   view-3  100 m from the edge, west-south-west, 1.7 m over the ground;
#   view-4  300 m west of the edge, 70 m over the ground: lower, the hills by the tavern hide the forest;
#   view-5  the hero runs 9 s north through the block of 64, the game's camera: from x 545 m, z -127 m, a line
#           without the hut, the farm's things and the original's trunks in it (they collide).
# The cameras stand by X0, Z0, STEP and NEST_ROW of fir_set.py: change both together.
seed 73013
cheat god
set time 12 0
cadence normal
overlay off
ui off
view full
walkmode run
watch player
goto pos 54140 1650 -10780
clear 3000
cam at 54140 1760 -10780 60000 2060 -10780
# Twenty real seconds after the teleport for loading and native simulation, as perf-meadow.bench
wait 20000
perf sample perf-trees/view-1
wait 8000
perf stop
shot inside
wait 200
goto pos 48765 6250 -3156
clear 5000
cam at 48765 6679 -3156 54140 2190 -10780
wait 20000
perf sample perf-trees/view-2
wait 8000
perf stop
shot near-30
wait 200
goto pos 42364 1700 -8973
clear 5000
cam at 42364 1808 -8973 54140 2490 -10780
wait 20000
perf sample perf-trees/view-3
wait 8000
perf stop
shot far-100
wait 200
goto pos 23216 4300 -8618
clear 5000
cam at 23216 11160 -8618 54140 2490 -10780
wait 20000
perf sample perf-trees/view-4
wait 8000
perf stop
shot far-300
wait 200
# the pass: the spruces have no collision, the hero runs straight through them
cam game
goto pos 54500 1640 -12700
clear 5000
face 110
wait 15000
press forward
wait 500
perf sample perf-trees/view-5
wait 9000
perf stop
shot pass
release forward
wait 500
